    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1599">

                <pb facs="1334" n="1230" xml:id="pg1230"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 723.2515/281.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Minister to Peru.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-12-14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Dec. 14, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Tacna-Arica agreement. Has Peruvian Congress adjourned without taking action as
                    reported from Chile?</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
